class_name IconArt
extends RefCounted
## Painted icons drawn in code: one glyph per idea (flame, ice shard, bolt, shield, sword, skull...), each a few layered shapes with its own colours.
## Skills, cards, statuses and items all use them, so a skill's icon shows what the skill actually does.
## A glyph is a list of layers; coordinates are in a unit square (-1..1, y down). Layer kinds:
##   ["p", key, [x, y, ...], smooth]       filled polygon (smooth = closed spline through the points)
##   ["c", key, cx, cy, r]                  filled circle
##   ["l", key, width, [x, y, ...]]         polyline
##   ["a", key, cx, cy, r, a0, a1, width]   arc outline (degrees)
## Colour keys: m main, d dark, l light, w white, k near-black, o accent. Each glyph can set its own palette; otherwise it is built from the tint.

